Package: zotFunc
Title: Zotero Integration Functions
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Rainer ", "Krug", , "Rainer@Krugs.de", role = c("aut", "cre", "maintainer"))
Description: Download complete Zotero group libraries via the Zotero Web API v3
    in any of Zotero's export formats, and keep the local copies up to date by
    re-downloading only groups that changed on the server.
